WEBVTT

00:17:58.792 --> 00:18:01.309
that black people have brought
to this country.

00:18:01.333 --> 00:18:04.601
Black people are
the protagonist of this story,

00:18:04.625 --> 00:18:06.059
and we need to make sure

00:18:06.083 --> 00:18:08.309
that as we work to build a new tomorrow,

00:18:08.333 --> 00:18:11.268
we ensure that the heroes
are at the center

00:18:11.292 --> 00:18:13.559
of the liberation that we all need.

00:18:13.583 --> 00:18:14.833
Thank you.

00:18:18.458 --> 00:18:19.917
CA: Thank you, Rashad.

00:18:21.333 --> 00:18:27.934
Dr. Bernice King is the CEO
of the King Center in Atlanta, Georgia.

00:18:27.958 --> 00:18:30.184
The center is a living memorial